The backend half of the `github_repo` setting (the cli half is in
phantom-cli/components/NewProject.tsx). Written when the SDK was in-tree;
main made it a submodule (github.com/stephengpope/phantom-agent-sdk) during
the landing, so it goes there. In a checkout of that repo:

    git apply --3way path/to/this.patch

then bump the submodule pin here and delete this file.

